{"id":"vod_bf_36166","vodId":"36166","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"我的青春恋爱物语果然有问题第二季","name_cn":"我的青春恋爱物语果然有问题第二季","date":"2015-01-01","year":"2015","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://img.bfzypic.com/upload/vod/20230424-37/e5c9ec121c2cba230243c333447e818a.jpg"},"summary":"因过去的心理阴影而以独自的别扭思考回路讴歌着“独自生活”的比企谷八幡，由于意外的事件而被生活指导担当教师平冢静带去“侍奉部”并加入其中。他和同社团所属的令人窒息的完美美少女·雪之下雪乃，以及班级上位阶级所属的时髦女子·由比滨结衣一同，从解决班上的人际关系问题到文化祭实行委员的运营，度过着解决各种案件的每一天。时至秋日，八幡等二年级学生前去修学旅行。此时，侍奉部接收到的委托究竟是！？随着新登场的一色彩羽的加入，他们的关系更加错综复杂。——八幡空虚的价值观也有了少许变化，在这些经验过后，他的高中生活又将迎来怎样的展开！？","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-04-29 22:48:12","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/wodeqingchunlianaiwuyuguoranyouwentidierji/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/wodeqingchunlianaiwuyuguoranyouwentidierji/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/wodeqingchunlianaiwuyuguoranyouwentidierji/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/wodeqingchunlianaiwuyuguoranyouwentidierji/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/wodeqingchunlianaiwuyuguoranyouwentidierji/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/wodeqingchunlianaiwuyuguoranyouwentidierji/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/wodeqingchunlianaiwuyuguoranyouwentidierji/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/wodeqingchunlianaiwuyuguoranyouwentidierji/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/wodeqingchunlianaiwuyuguoranyouwentidierji/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/wodeqingchunlianaiwuyuguoranyouwentidierji/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/wode